    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udeb4 Adventures of Deliveryman \ud83d\udeb4</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a simple and incredibly charming action game about a bike courier, where you can have fun exploring the city on a bicycle and playing with physics. <br><br><strong>Customise your bike</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.poster.avif?t=1746557495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.webm?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.mp4?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Ride around, knock over pedestrians in your path, grind rails in spectacular slides during your deliveries, or pull off aerial stunts. But the coolest part? You can become a true extreme master, defying the laws of physics and space! Imagine: you do a backflip off a rooftop, land in a slide, and top it all off with a combo that doubles your points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/8018aca959b63be0d35dcb26aae3d08e.avif?t=1746557495\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Explore the City's Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The action occurs in an open city full of life: crowds of people are rushing about their business, heading from home to work or the store. Thousands of pedestrians will block your way, making it harder to deliver packages on time. And if the pedestrians aren't enough of an obstacle, beware of villains behind the wheel of cars\u2014they\u2019ll try to knock you down on your route.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All tricks can be chained into combos, bringing bonus points. Complete missions, collect upgrade cards, and level up your bike. Upgrades can be installed directly in the garage through a handy menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/0bf022ee368542cc8f76838e21119703.poster.avif?t=1746557495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/0bf022ee368542cc8f76838e21119703.webm?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/0bf022ee368542cc8f76838e21119703.mp4?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each delivery takes you to <strong>new locations</strong> and introduces intriguing citizens. Make choices that shape your path and uncover <strong>hidden city mysteries</strong>! \ud83d\udd0d\ud83d\udcac</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Thrilling Delivery Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than just a delivery job, every mission is a <strong>puzzle</strong>! Master boosts, jumps, slides, and swerves through <strong>city traffic</strong> to deliver packages with speed and skill. \ud83d\udca8\ud83d\udef5</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">But be careful: death in the game is permanent. If you fail, you'll have to start over from the beginning. However, with each attempt, you'll gain new knowledge and experience, allowing you to progress faster and sharpen your skills to perfection.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Build and Customize Your Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.poster.avif?t=1746557495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.webm?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.mp4?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your <strong>garage</strong> is your sanctuary. Build the <strong>ultimate delivery bike</strong> from blueprints and unlock cool <strong>outfits and accessories</strong> to express your style. \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game spans one intense and action-packed day in the life of a delivery service courier. Are you ready for the challenge? \ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2642\ufe0f.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udeb4 Adventures of Deliveryman \ud83d\udeb4</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a simple and incredibly charming action game about a bike courier, where you can have fun exploring the city on a bicycle and playing with physics. <br><br><strong>Customise your bike</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.poster.avif?t=1746557495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.webm?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.mp4?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Ride around, knock over pedestrians in your path, grind rails in spectacular slides during your deliveries, or pull off aerial stunts. But the coolest part? You can become a true extreme master, defying the laws of physics and space! Imagine: you do a backflip off a rooftop, land in a slide, and top it all off with a combo that doubles your points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/8018aca959b63be0d35dcb26aae3d08e.avif?t=1746557495\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Explore the City's Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The action occurs in an open city full of life: crowds of people are rushing about their business, heading from home to work or the store. Thousands of pedestrians will block your way, making it harder to deliver packages on time. And if the pedestrians aren't enough of an obstacle, beware of villains behind the wheel of cars\u2014they\u2019ll try to knock you down on your route.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All tricks can be chained into combos, bringing bonus points. Complete missions, collect upgrade cards, and level up your bike. Upgrades can be installed directly in the garage through a handy menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/0bf022ee368542cc8f76838e21119703.poster.avif?t=1746557495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/0bf022ee368542cc8f76838e21119703.webm?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/0bf022ee368542cc8f76838e21119703.mp4?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each delivery takes you to <strong>new locations</strong> and introduces intriguing citizens. Make choices that shape your path and uncover <strong>hidden city mysteries</strong>! \ud83d\udd0d\ud83d\udcac</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Thrilling Delivery Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than just a delivery job, every mission is a <strong>puzzle</strong>! Master boosts, jumps, slides, and swerves through <strong>city traffic</strong> to deliver packages with speed and skill. \ud83d\udca8\ud83d\udef5</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">But be careful: death in the game is permanent. If you fail, you'll have to start over from the beginning. However, with each attempt, you'll gain new knowledge and experience, allowing you to progress faster and sharpen your skills to perfection.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Build and Customize Your Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.poster.avif?t=1746557495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.webm?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997940/extras/60e0ca06f5607456e425719477d3fae6.mp4?t=1746557495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your <strong>garage</strong> is your sanctuary. Build the <strong>ultimate delivery bike</strong> from blueprints and unlock cool <strong>outfits and accessories</strong> to express your style. \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game spans one intense and action-packed day in the life of a delivery service courier. Are you ready for the challenge? \ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2642\ufe0f.</h2>",
